        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261107-w3975dff5b107",
        "model": "GPT-6.1-Sol"
      },
      "text": "Stay at Hotel Fiesta in the Galápagos, see giant tortoises in the Santa Cruz highlands and spend two or three days diving among sea lions, sea turtles, rays and sharks. Choose a four- or five-day programme, with two dives on each diving day."
    },
